Error [E0601]: `test` blocks only belong at the top of a file
  --> tests/ui/test_block_nested.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     test "not allowed here" {
    |     ^^^^
 Why: test blocks group checks that `jet test` runs separately from `main`
 Fix: move this block to the top level, after your functions: test "name" { ... }
